title: Add // prefix shortcut for queued followup messages
updated_at: "2026-08-02T12:13:58Z"
---
Messages starting with // (optionally followed by space or newline) should be queued as followup messages that wait until the agent finishes its current work before being delivered. This provides a quick shortcut for steering without interrupting the active turn.